:40.576807,"lng":-4.204883,"ele":1370.2},{"lat":40.576793,"lng":-4.204975,"ele":1369.7},{"lat":40.576778,"lng":-4.205075,"ele":1369},{"lat":40.576775,"lng":-4.205094,"ele":1368.9},{"lat":40.576763,"lng":-4.205177,"ele":1368.4},{"lat":40.576761,"lng":-4.205187,"ele":1368.3},{"lat":40.576757,"lng":-4.205218,"ele":1368.1},{"lat":40.576753,"lng":-4.205242,"ele":1367.9},{"lat":40.576741,"lng":-4.205324,"ele":1367.2},{"lat":40.576722,"lng":-4.205449,"ele":1366.2},{"lat":40.576694,"lng":-4.205665,"ele":1364.1},{"lat":40.576694,"lng":-4.205741,"ele":1363.6},{"lat":40.576694,"lng":-4.205754,"ele":1363.5},{"lat":40.576694,"lng":-4.205916,"ele":1362.6},{"lat":40.576709,"lng":-4.2061,"ele":1362.4},{"lat":40.57671,"lng":-4.206115,"ele":1362.4},{"lat":40.576712,"lng":-4.206131,"ele":1362.4},{"lat":40.576733,"lng":-4.206295,"ele":1362.2},{"lat":40.576795,"lng":-4.206706,"ele":1359.9},{"lat":40.576832,"lng":-4.206795,"ele":1359.6}]'::jsonb),
('wikiloc', '166498607', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/busmayor-faxeiral-pico-faro-pico-capeloso-campo-de-liebre-busmayor-166498607', 'Busmayor - Faxeiral - Pico Faro - Pico Capeloso - Campo de Liebre - Busmayor', '{"en":"Busmayor loop via Faxeiral and Capeloso","ca":"Circular Busmayor per Faxeiral i Capeloso","es":"Circular Busmayor por Faxeiral y Capeloso"}'::jsonb, 'Busmayor -Faxeiral-Pico Faro-Pico Capeloso-Campo de Liebre -Busmayor Hiking trail in Busmayor, Castilla y León (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Saliendo de la iglesia de Busmayor recorremos el pueblo y nos adentramos en la ruta del Faxeiral con sus cascadas del agua del deshielo,seguimos camino del pico Faro y cresteando llegamos Al Capeloso con refugio para el temtempie .Desde el refugio en descenso por sendas y caminos llegaremos a Campo de Liebre ,y desde aqui hasta Busmayor hay un tramo de camino asfalto sin circulacion ,sobre 2km', '{"en":"This moderate 18.6 km loop starts from the church in Busmayor, traversing the village before entering the Faxeiral route. This section features impressive meltwater waterfalls, leading towards Pico Faro.\n\nThe trail then follows a ridge to Pico Capeloso, where a refuge offers a convenient spot for a break. From the refuge, the route descends via paths and tracks to Campo de Liebre. The final 2 km back to Busmayor follow a quiet asphalt road with no traffic.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 18.6 km comença des de l''església de Busmayor, travessant el poble abans d''endinsar-se a la ruta del Faxeiral. Aquesta secció presenta impressionants cascades d''aigua de desglaç, que condueixen cap al Pico Faro.\n\nEl camí segueix una carena fins al Pico Capeloso, on un refugi ofereix un punt convenient per a una pausa. Des del refugi, la ruta descendeix per senders i camins fins a Campo de Liebre. Els últims 2 km de tornada a Busmayor segueixen una carretera asfaltada tranquil·la sense trànsit.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 18.6 km parte de la iglesia de Busmayor, recorriendo el pueblo antes de adentrarse en la ruta del Faxeiral. Esta sección presenta impresionantes cascadas de agua de deshielo, que conducen hacia el Pico Faro.\n\nEl sendero sigue una cresta hasta el Pico Capeloso, donde un refugio ofrece un punto conveniente para un descanso. Desde el refugio, la ruta desciende por sendas y caminos hasta Campo de Liebre. Los últimos 2 km de regreso a Busmayor siguen un tramo de camino asfaltado sin circulación."}'::jsonb, 'orenciocanedo', 18572, 988, 988, 1613, 1049, 'moderate', 'loop', 16320, 21240, 3220, '2024-04-06', '2024-03', '[{"lat":42.623593,"lng":-7.013943,"ele":1056.9},{"lat":42.623545,"lng":-7.01394,"ele":1056.9},{"lat":42.62359,"lng":-7.013912,"ele":1056.4},{"lat":42.623638,"lng":-7.013917,"ele":1056},{"lat":42.623685,"lng":-7.013912,"ele":1055.6},{"lat":42.623737,"lng":-7.013917,"ele":1054.9},{"lat":42.623787,"lng":-7.013914,"ele":1054.3},{"lat":42.623834,"lng":-7.013901,"ele":1052.4},{"lat":42.623891,"lng":-7.013898,"ele":1050.9},{"lat":42.623943,"lng":-7.013906,"ele":1050.7},{"lat":42.623991,"lng":-7.013933,"ele":1050.9},{"lat":42.624039,"lng":-7.013938,"ele":1051.3},{"lat":42.624087,"lng":-7.013926,"ele":1051.1},{"lat":42.62413,"lng":-7.013944,"ele":1050.8},{"lat":42.624172,"lng":-7.013971,"ele":1049.9},{"lat":42.62422,"lng":-7.013964,"ele":1049.3},{"lat":42.624293,"lng":-7.013962,"ele":1048.8},{"lat":42.62433,"lng":-7.013915,"ele":1048.7},{"lat":42.624378,"lng":-7.013892,"ele":1048.8},{"lat":42.624418,"lng":-7.013864,"ele":1048.8},{"lat":42.62447,"lng":-7.013841,"ele":1048.8},{"lat":42.624515,"lng":-7.013799,"ele":1050.1},{"lat":42.62455,"lng":-7.013752,"ele":1051.4},{"lat":42.624593,"lng":-7.013704,"ele":1053.1},{"lat":42.624633,"lng":-7.013662,"ele":1053.4},{"lat":42.624678,"lng":-7.013635,"ele":1054.1},{"lat":42.624726,"lng":-7.01362,"ele":1054.8},{"lat":42.624773,"lng":-7.013608,"ele":1055.6},{"lat":42.624828,"lng":-7.013603,"ele":1056.4},{"lat":42.62