('wikiloc', '177272950', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/benicadell-vespresda-nit-177272950', 'BENICADELL (Evening-Night)', '{"en":"Evening loop from Port d''Albaida","ca":"Circular vespertina des del Port d''Albaida","es":"Circular vespertina desde Port d''Albaida"}'::jsonb, 'BENICADELL (Vespresda-nit) Hiking trail in Turballos, Valencia (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta de Parquing Port d'' Albaida a Benicadell pasando por:
- Font de Fontanares (1.3 km)
- Cava don Miguel (2.9 km)
- Coll de Turballos (4.3 km).
- Collado Poste Pr CV (6.2 km)
- Nevera del Benicadell (6.6 km)
- Collado y Cima del Benicadell 

Ruta de verano muy bonita, con muchas panoramicas para realizar por las tardes, cenar y bajar luego de noche con los frontales...', '{"en":"This moderate loop to Benicadell is designed for an evening-night hike, starting from the Port d''Albaida parking area. The route offers beautiful panoramic views, ideal for enjoying the sunset and then descending with headlamps.\n\nThe trail passes by Font de Fontanares, Cava don Miguel, Coll de Turballos, and the Nevera del Benicadell before reaching the Collado and summit of Benicadell. It''s a pleasant summer route, perfect for a unique experience.\n\nCovering 14.9 km with 853m of elevation gain, this trail is suitable for hikers comfortable with night hiking and moderate ascents.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada al Benicadell està dissenyada per a una excursió de vespre-nit, començant des de l''aparcament del Port d''Albaida. La ruta ofereix boniques vistes panoràmiques, ideals per gaudir de la posta de sol i després baixar amb frontals.\n\nEl sender passa per la Font de Fontanares, la Cava don Miguel, el Coll de Turballos i la Nevera del Benicadell abans d''arribar al Collado i al cim del Benicadell. És una ruta d''estiu agradable, perfecta per a una experiència única.\n\nAmb 14,9 km i 853m de desnivell positiu, aquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes còmodes amb la caminada nocturna i ascensos moderats.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada al Benicadell está diseñada para una excursión de tarde-noche, comenzando desde el aparcamiento del Port d''Albaida. La ruta ofrece hermosas vistas panorámicas, ideales para disfrutar del atardecer y luego descender con frontales.\n\nEl sendero pasa por la Font de Fontanares, la Cava don Miguel, el Coll de Turballos y la Nevera del Benicadell antes de llegar al Collado y la cima del Benicadell. Es una ruta de verano muy bonita, perfecta para una experiencia única.\n\nCon 14,9 km y 853m de desnivel positivo, esta ruta es adecuada para senderistas cómodos con la caminata nocturna y ascensos moderados."}'::jsonb, 'Eliseo B.B.', 14919, 853, 853, 1061, 548, 'moderate', 'loop', 15840, 20640, 2671, '2024-07-13', '2024-06', '[{"lat":38.810261,"lng":-0.468131,"ele":568.8},{"lat":38.810217,"lng":-0.468094,"ele":568.8},{"lat":38.810185,"lng":-0.468052,"ele":567.4},{"lat":38.810158,"lng":-0.467996,"ele":567.1},{"lat":38.810124,"lng":-0.467947,"ele":567.1},{"lat":38.810079,"lng":-0.467931,"ele":567.1},{"lat":38.810063,"lng":-0.467872,"ele":567},{"lat":38.810068,"lng":-0.467813,"ele":567},{"lat":38.810108,"lng":-0.46778,"ele":565.6},{"lat":38.810149,"lng":-0.467747,"ele":564},{"lat":38.81018,"lng":-0.467703,"ele":563.9},{"lat":38.810205,"lng":-0.467653,"ele":564.4},{"lat":38.810243,"lng":-0.467609,"ele":565.2},{"lat":38.810285,"lng":-0.467579,"ele":567.3},{"lat":38.810333,"lng":-0.467555,"ele":568.8},{"lat":38.810369,"lng":-0.467514,"ele":569.7},{"lat":38.810417,"lng":-0.467489,"ele":570.2},{"lat":38.810468,"lng":-0.467476,"ele":570.4},{"lat":38.810508,"lng":-0.467445,"ele":570.3},{"lat":38.810554,"lng":-0.467423,"ele":570.1},{"lat":38.810606,"lng":-0.467417,"ele":569.8},{"lat":38.810654,"lng":-0.467429,"ele":570.1},{"lat":38.810686,"lng":-0.467381,"ele":570.1},{"lat":38.810728,"lng":-0.467348,"ele":570.5},{"lat":38.810773,"lng":-0.467317,"ele":570.6},{"lat":38.810803,"lng":-0.467272,"ele":570.8},{"lat":38.810834,"lng":-0.467225,"ele":571.8},{"lat":38.810873,"lng":-0.467185,"ele":572.6},{"lat":38.810904,"lng":-0.467136,"ele":573},{"lat":38.81094,"lng":-0.467093,"ele":573.3},{"lat":38.810988,"lng":-0.467104,"ele":574.4},{"lat":38.811036,"lng":-0.467095,"ele":575},{"lat":38.811085,"lng":-0.467078,"ele":575.3},{"lat":38.811136,"lng":-0.467064,"ele":575.4},{"lat":38.811188,"lng":-0.467061,"ele":575.5},{"lat":38.811231,"lng":-0.467023,"ele":575.6},{"lat":38.811211,"lng":-0.466971,"ele":575.8},{"lat":38.811202,"lng":-0.466911,"ele":576},{"lat":38.811205,"lng":-0.46685,"ele":576.3},{"lat":38.811204,"lng":-0.466784,"ele":576.7},{"lat":38.811193,"lng":-0.466717