('wikiloc', '179247912', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/rf-cabrones-torre-bermeja-torre-coello-tiro-del-oso-horcada-de-cain-cain-poncebos-179247912', 'Cabrones Refuge - Torre Bermeja - Torre Coello - Tiro del Oso - Horcada de Cain - Cain - Poncebos.', '{"en":"From Cabrones Refuge to Poncebos","ca":"Des del Refugi de Cabrones a Poncebos","es":"Desde el Refugio de Cabrones a Poncebos"}'::jsonb, 'Rf. Cabrones - Torre Bermeja - Torre Coello - Tiro del Oso - Horcada de Cain - Cain - Poncebos. Hiking trail in Caín, Castilla y León (España). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This difficult one-way route covers 26.1 km with a significant 2473m of elevation gain, starting from Refugio de Cabrones. It''s a demanding traverse through the Picos de Europa, suitable for experienced hikers.\n\nThe trail leads over multiple prominent peaks, including Torre Bermeja, Torre Coello, and Tiro del Oso. After these ascents, the route descends via Horcada de Caín towards Caín, and finally concludes the long journey at Poncebos. Expect varied terrain and sustained effort.","ca":"Aquesta ruta lineal difícil de 26.1 km amb un desnivell positiu considerable de 2473m, comença des del Refugi de Cabrones. És una travessa exigent pels Picos de Europa, apta per a excursionistes experimentats.\n\nEl camí passa per diversos cims prominents, incloent Torre Bermeja, Torre Coello i Tiro del Oso. Després d''aquestes ascensions, la ruta descendeix per la Horcada de Caín cap a Caín, i finalment conclou el llarg recorregut a Poncebos. Espereu-vos a un terreny variat i un esforç sostingut.","es":"Esta ruta lineal difícil cubre 26.1 km con un significativo desnivel positivo de 2473m, comenzando desde el Refugio de Cabrones. Es una travesía exigente por los Picos de Europa, adecuada para excursionistas experimentados.\n\nEl sendero pasa por múltiples picos prominentes, incluyendo Torre Bermeja, Torre Coello y Tiro del Oso. Después de estas ascensiones, la ruta desciende por la Horcada de Caín hacia Caín, y finalmente concluye el largo viaje en Poncebos. Espere un terreno variado y un esfuerzo sostenido."}'::jsonb, 'Domingo Ruiz-Canales', 26071, 2473, 4294, 2609, 163, 'difficult', 'one-way', 27900, 13980, 4508, '2024-07-30', '2024-06', '[{"lat":43.21405,"lng":-4.85763,"ele":2043.9},{"lat":43.214001,"lng":-4.857632,"ele":2043.1},{"lat":43.21401,"lng":-4.857565,"ele":2043.1},{"lat":43.21399,"lng":-4.857508,"ele":2043},{"lat":43.213948,"lng":-4.857469,"ele":2043},{"lat":43.213911,"lng":-4.857426,"ele":2041.9},{"lat":43.213867,"lng":-4.857404,"ele":2039.8},{"lat":43.213849,"lng":-4.857346,"ele":2037},{"lat":43.213812,"lng":-4.857295,"ele":2034.9},{"lat":43.213766,"lng":-4.857272,"ele":2032.8},{"lat":43.213721,"lng":-4.857234,"ele":2031.6},{"lat":43.213679,"lng":-4.857192,"ele":2030.8},{"lat":43.21363,"lng":-4.857167,"ele":2030.2},{"lat":43.213592,"lng":-4.857122,"ele":2029.7},{"lat":43.213547,"lng":-4.857101,"ele":2028.2},{"lat":43.213501,"lng":-4.857125,"ele":2022.2},{"lat":43.213486,"lng":-4.85719,"ele":2022.2},{"lat":43.2135,"lng":-4.857127,"ele":2024.9},{"lat":43.213528,"lng":-4.857075,"ele":2024.8},{"lat":43.213477,"lng":-4.857062,"ele":2021.6},{"lat":43.21343,"lng":-4.857026,"ele":2021.6},{"lat":43.213383,"lng":-4.856994,"ele":2021.6},{"lat":43.213361,"lng":-4.856933,"ele":2021.6},{"lat":43.21337,"lng":-4.856863,"ele":2021.3},{"lat":43.213396,"lng":-4.856802,"ele":2021.3},{"lat":43.213416,"lng":-4.85674,"ele":2021.1},{"lat":43.213414,"lng":-4.85667,"ele":2020.5},{"lat":43.213394,"lng":-4.856608,"ele":2020.4},{"lat":43.213384,"lng":-4.856544,"ele":2020.2},{"lat":43.213408,"lng":-4.856489,"ele":2020.2},{"lat":43.213407,"lng":-4.856427,"ele":2020.4},{"lat":43.213411,"lng":-4.856362,"ele":2020.4},{"lat":43.213424,"lng":-4.856291,"ele":2020.3},{"lat":43.213431,"lng":-4.856227,"ele":2020.1},{"lat":43.213442,"lng":-4.856166,"ele":2019.7},{"lat