('wikiloc', '21024888', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/cim-de-ponoig-pr-cv-13-1-21024888', 'Cim de ponoig PR-CV 13,1', '{"en":"Circular via PR-CV 13.1","ca":"Circular per PR-CV 13.1","es":"Circular por PR-CV 13.1"}'::jsonb, 'Cim de ponoig PR-CV 13,1 Hiking trail in Polop, Valencia (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Nice route, aking olive fields and forrest. Amaizing view at the summit.', '{"en":"This moderate 11.4 km loop to Cim de Ponoig follows the PR-CV 13.1 trail. The route traverses olive fields and forest sections, offering a varied landscape.\n\nThe climb is steady, leading to the summit with its expansive views. The trail is well-marked and suitable for hikers looking for a rewarding day out without extreme technical challenges.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 11,4 km al Cim de Ponoig segueix el sender PR-CV 13.1. La ruta travessa camps d''oliveres i trams de bosc, oferint un paisatge variat.\n\nLa pujada és constant, conduint al cim amb les seves vistes extenses. El sender està ben senyalitzat i és adequat per a excursionistes que busquen una jornada gratificant sense reptes tècnics extrems.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 11,4 km al Cim de Ponoig sigue el sendero PR-CV 13.1. La ruta atraviesa campos de olivos y tramos de bosque, ofreciendo un paisaje variado.\n\nLa subida es constante, conduciendo a la cumbre con sus vistas extensas. El sendero está bien señalizado y es adecuado para excursionistas que buscan una jornada gratificante sin desafíos técnicos extremos."}'::jsonb, '#karioghåkonpåtur', 11378, 660, 660, 1185, 493, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 17520, 2022, '2017-11-16', '2017-10', '[{"lat":38.625103,"lng":-0.161772,"ele":493.2},{"lat":38.625142,"lng":-0.161549,"ele":516},{"lat":38.625176,"lng":-0.161462,"ele":533.1},{"lat":38.625147,"lng":-0.161509,"ele":526.8},{"lat":38.625128,"lng":-0.161564,"ele":529.3},{"lat":38.625081,"lng":-0.161566,"ele":529},{"lat":38.625066,"lng":-0.161623,"ele":529.6}